{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】警方晚上在尖沙咀截查一輛可疑私家車，檢獲毒品拘捕司機。</p>\n<p>被捕男司機被押到私家車旁邊調查，緝毒犬亦到場協助搜證。晚上十時左右，警方在麼地道近碧仙桃路發現一輛可疑私家車，於是截停搜查，在車內發現懷疑毒品，當場拘捕司機。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T16:19:10.766324+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T15:54:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T16:17:34.967865+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T16:17:34.967865+00:00","content_hash":"fe2036b5c2e1cc9f724b51c87d5f70b734bc5631f190de7434911717f6782131","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}